mono_pit_khz_rs

# rustkern/earlyfb.rs - #ASUSDIAG the boot-stage tracker painted straight to the
# firmware framebuffer, live from the first instruction of kernel_main. C API in
# video/earlyfb.h, driven by fs/bootstage.c. No dependency on fb_init(), the
# heap, the PMM or the console: on a laptop, which has no serial port, this is
# the only diagnostic channel that exists before a filesystem mounts.
