dos_bus_selftest_rs
# (#252) The same accumulator, charged an explicit interval instead of one bus
# cycle. A BIOS wait (INT 15h AH=86h) is non-instruction emulated time and must
# land in the SAME ticks_charged dos_emu_clock_rate() reads, or it advances the
# guest's clock past the wall clock.
dos_bus_charge_us_rs

# (#252) rustkern/dosint15.rs: INT 15h AH=86h, the BIOS WAIT. Monkey Island
# times its AdLib probe's 80 us with this call rather than with port reads, so
# #176's bus cost never reached it and the probe concluded "no chip".
dos_int15_rs
dos_int15_selftest_rs

