# interrupt: the bridge by which a 32-bit DOS/4GW guest reaches the ONE INT
# 21h service core (#736). Owner: dos/dpmi_rmcs.c, which holds the layout
# locks and the default service router. The four dpmi_arena_* symbols are
# THE guest-memory bounds chokepoint and are bound into dos_svc_ctx_t.mem,
