# rustkern/clickacct.rs - #197 click delivery ledger for the #334 test-input
# channel. Splits a synthetic click into INJECTED / SAMPLED / ROUTED / HIT so
# the gap between counts names the layer that lost it, instead of trusting an
# ACK line that only ever proved the parser ran. clickacct_note_sample_rs is
# called from sys_get_mouse() and also reports left-button EDGES, which is what
