# --- rustkern/uiscale.rs: THE GLOBAL UI SCALE FACTOR -------------------------
# Owner: UI/UX. One value, one place, reached by the kernel (theme metrics,
# window chrome, the window-boundary transform) and by Ring 3 (SYS_UI_SCALE).
# The _at_ variants take the factor explicitly and exist for exactly one
# caller, uw_rescale_all(), which converts a live window between TWO factors
